WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.355
Valles Marineris.

00:02.037 --> 00:08.651
A canyon nearly four thousand kilometres long, which on Earth would reach from one side of the United States to the other.

00:09.231 --> 00:11.586
In places it is nine kilometres deep.

00:12.150 --> 00:16.995
It began as a crack, when the volcanoes beside it swelled and the ground split.
